Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:04:10.06,HEADA,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}▍{\r\fn得意黑}2026 国家银行公开赛（蒙特利尔）决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:04:10.06,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}谢尔顿 {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&HFFFFFF&\fs44}6-3 7-6(4){\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC} 中岛布兰登 · 赛后捧杯致辞
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.72,0:00:02.48,EN,,0,0,0,,Well, uh, uh, first of all,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.72,0:00:02.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,首先
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.48,0:00:04.48,EN,,0,0,0,,and most importantly, I want to thank God.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.48,0:00:04.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,也是最重要的 我要感谢上帝
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.48,0:00:07.20,EN,,0,0,0,,Um, I would be nowhere without my faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.48,0:00:07.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,没有信仰 就没有今天的我
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.20,0:00:09.28,EN,,0,0,0,,Uh, that's what's most important to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.20,0:00:09.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,这对我来说是最重要的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.28,0:00:15.92,EN,,0,0,0,,So, I want to congratulate Brandon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.28,0:00:15.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,我要恭喜布兰登
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.92,0:00:20.84,EN,,0,0,0,,Um, first of all, hell of a speech.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.92,0:00:20.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,首先 刚才那番话说得真棒
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.60,0:00:26.56,EN,,0,0,0,,Uh but no, seriously, to see the the way
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.60,0:00:26.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,说真的 看到你这一周
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.56,0:00:29.76,EN,,0,0,0,,that you played this week, um the way
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.56,0:00:29.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,打出来的表现
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.76,0:00:31.28,EN,,0,0,0,,that you've been playing, I know
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.76,0:00:31.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有你最近这段时间的状态
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.28,0:00:33.52,EN,,0,0,0,,that people here may not have been tuned
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.28,0:00:33.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,这里的观众可能没关注
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.52,0:00:36.80,EN,,0,0,0,,into DC last week, but uh to see the level
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.52,0:00:36.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,上周的华盛顿站
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.80,0:00:38.48,EN,,0,0,0,,that you were playing there,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.80,0:00:38.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,但看到你在那儿的水准
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.48,0:00:40.16,EN,,0,0,0,,uh to see the work that you and your team
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.48,0:00:40.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,看到你和团队下的功夫
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.16,0:00:42.72,EN,,0,0,0,,have been putting in and uh your evolution
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.16,0:00:42.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有你作为球员的成长
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.72,0:00:44.88,EN,,0,0,0,,as a player has been so cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.72,0:00:44.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,都特别酷
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.88,0:00:48.72,EN,,0,0,0,,Um you are the the the future
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.88,0:00:48.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,你代表着未来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.72,0:00:50.00,EN,,0,0,0,,of American tennis.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.72,0:00:50.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,美国网球的未来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.00,0:00:51.68,EN,,0,0,0,,we all are and it's so cool
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.00,0:00:51.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们都是 而且很酷的是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.68,0:00:53.12,EN,,0,0,0,,to be on this journey with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.68,0:00:53.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,能和你一起走这一路
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.12,0:00:59.84,EN,,0,0,0,,So, uh, congrats on this week and seriously,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.12,0:00:59.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以 恭喜你这一周
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.84,0:01:03.44,EN,,0,0,0,,good luck the rest of this season.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.84,0:01:03.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,也祝你这个赛季接下来顺利
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.44,0:01:05.12,EN,,0,0,0,,I want to thank my team.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.44,0:01:05.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,我要感谢我的团队
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.12,0:01:09.44,EN,,0,0,0,,Uh, it's crazy that we were here a year ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.12,0:01:09.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,很神奇 一年前我们也在这儿
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.44,0:01:11.60,EN,,0,0,0,,Um, well, I guess in Toronto.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.44,0:01:11.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,呃 好吧 那是在多伦多
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.60,0:01:15.20,EN,,0,0,0,,Uh, I I'm not going to say anything bad
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.60,0:01:15.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,我可不会说
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.20,0:01:15.84,EN,,0,0,0,,about Toronto.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.20,0:01:15.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,多伦多的坏话
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.84,0:01:18.00,EN,,0,0,0,,I I love Toronto, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.84,0:01:18.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,我也很爱多伦多
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.00,0:01:28.28,EN,,0,0,0,,Um, but Montreal just as much.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.00,0:01:28.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,但蒙特利尔我一样爱
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.76,0:01:34.72,EN,,0,0,0,,Uh, you guys have paved the way for me,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.76,0:01:34.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,你们为我铺好了路
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.72,0:01:36.32,EN,,0,0,0,,made everything possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.72,0:01:36.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,让这一切成为可能
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.32,0:01:38.08,EN,,0,0,0,,Um, the team that I have around me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.32,0:01:38.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,我身边的这个团队
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.08,0:01:39.44,EN,,0,0,0,,is amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.08,0:01:39.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,了不起
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.44,0:01:42.24,EN,,0,0,0,,Uh, FedE, you've been such a great addition
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.44,0:01:42.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,费德 你加入这个团队
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.24,0:01:43.92,EN,,0,0,0,,to this team.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.24,0:01:43.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.92,0:01:46.48,EN,,0,0,0,,and uh you're the only person here
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.92,0:01:46.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,你是现在我这个包厢里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.48,0:01:48.56,EN,,0,0,0,,in my box right now that's not family.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.48,0:01:48.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,唯一一个不是家人的人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.56,0:01:51.44,EN,,0,0,0,,So uh I appreciate uh your commitment
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.56,0:01:51.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢你为我这么尽心
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.44,0:01:52.24,EN,,0,0,0,,to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.44,0:01:52.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,我很感激
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.24,0:01:53.76,EN,,0,0,0,,Uh this has been a fun ride
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.24,0:01:53.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,这一路很尽兴
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.76,0:01:55.12,EN,,0,0,0,,and we're only getting started.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.76,0:01:55.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,而我们才刚刚开始
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.12,0:01:57.28,EN,,0,0,0,,But to my family, you guys have been there
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.12,0:01:57.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有我的家人 你们始终陪着我
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.28,0:01:59.04,EN,,0,0,0,,since since the beginning
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.28,0:01:59.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,从最开始就是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.04,0:02:01.36,EN,,0,0,0,,and uh always supported me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.04,0:02:01.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,一直支持着我
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.36,0:02:05.52,EN,,0,0,0,,My uncle, he'll fly to Australia to see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.36,0:02:05.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,我叔叔会飞去澳大利亚看我
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.52,0:02:09.92,EN,,0,0,0,,And uh I don't know how many uncles
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.52,0:02:09.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,我不知道有几个叔叔
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.92,0:02:10.64,EN,,0,0,0,,will do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.92,0:02:10.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,会这么干
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.64,0:02:12.80,EN,,0,0,0,,So, uh, to my parents, Uncle Rick,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.64,0:02:12.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以 我的父母 里克叔叔
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.80,0:02:13.60,EN,,0,0,0,,I appreciate you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.80,0:02:13.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,我很感激你们
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.60,0:02:17.00,EN,,0,0,0,,Love you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.60,0:02:17.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,爱你们
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.44,0:02:24.24,EN,,0,0,0,,Uh, to the sponsors, uh, National Bank,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.44,0:02:24.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有赞助商 国家银行
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.24,0:02:26.80,EN,,0,0,0,,Rogers, uh, to Tennis Canada,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.24,0:02:26.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,罗渣士 加拿大网球协会
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.80,0:02:29.60,EN,,0,0,0,,everyone who makes this event possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.80,0:02:29.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,每一个让这站赛事办起来的人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.60,0:02:32.00,EN,,0,0,0,,It's a outstanding event.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.60,0:02:32.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,这是一站出色的赛事
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.00,0:02:33.92,EN,,0,0,0,,Uh it's run so well
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.00,0:02:33.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,办得非常好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.92,0:02:35.76,EN,,0,0,0,,and a lot of people don't see the behind
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.92,0:02:35.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,很多人看不到
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.76,0:02:37.92,EN,,0,0,0,,the scenes work, but I appreciate you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.76,0:02:37.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,幕后的付出 但我很感激你们
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.92,0:02:40.40,EN,,0,0,0,,All the volunteers, the drivers,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.92,0:02:40.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,所有志愿者 司机
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.40,0:02:45.52,EN,,0,0,0,,the ball kids, uh the stringers,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.40,0:02:45.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,球童 穿线师
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.52,0:02:47.44,EN,,0,0,0,,uh the people at the practice desk,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.52,0:02:47.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,练习场登记台的工作人员
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.44,0:02:53.44,EN,,0,0,0,,the umpires, uh tour managers, uh press,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.44,0:02:53.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,裁判 巡回赛主管 媒体
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.44,0:02:55.20,EN,,0,0,0,,um the list goes on and on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.44,0:02:55.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,还能一直数下去
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.20,0:02:59.36,EN,,0,0,0,,But um this is a a big operation uh
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.20,0:02:59.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,这是一个庞大的运转
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.36,0:03:02.64,EN,,0,0,0,,a serious serious event and to be a part
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.36,0:03:02.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,一站非常正式的赛事
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.64,0:03:04.72,EN,,0,0,0,,of it is is an honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.64,0:03:04.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,能参与其中是我的荣幸
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.72,0:03:08.52,EN,,0,0,0,,So thank all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.72,0:03:08.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢你们所有人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.24,0:03:16.80,EN,,0,0,0,,Last of all, I want to thank the fans.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.24,0:03:16.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,最后 我要感谢球迷
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.80,0:03:27.04,EN,,0,0,0,,Uh Tennis wise, this has been one
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.80,0:03:27.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,从网球本身来说
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.04,0:03:29.44,EN,,0,0,0,,of the best weeks of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.04,0:03:29.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,这是我人生中最好的一周之一
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.44,0:03:32.64,EN,,0,0,0,,Um, I've played some of the best tennis
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.44,0:03:32.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,我打出了我这辈子
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.64,0:03:35.60,EN,,0,0,0,,that I've ever played, and to be able to put
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.64,0:03:35.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,最好的一些网球
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.60,0:03:39.68,EN,,0,0,0,,that uh on display here in front of you, um,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.60,0:03:39.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,能在你们面前展现出来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.68,0:03:40.64,EN,,0,0,0,,has been an honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.68,0:03:40.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,是我的荣幸
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.64,0:03:41.36,EN,,0,0,0,,So, thank you guys
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.64,0:03:41.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以 谢谢你们
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.36,0:03:45.48,EN,,0,0,0,,for bringing the energy all week.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.36,0:03:45.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,这一整周带来的热情
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.16,0:03:51.92,EN,,0,0,0,,I I love this game.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.16,0:03:51.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,我热爱这项运动
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.92,0:03:53.84,EN,,0,0,0,,Uh, I love competing
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.92,0:03:53.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,我热爱竞争
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.84,0:03:57.68,EN,,0,0,0,,and uh I may not win every time I play,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.84,0:03:57.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,我不一定每场都能赢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.68,0:04:00.40,EN,,0,0,0,,but I always leave it all on the court.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.68,0:04:00.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,但我总会把一切都留在场上
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.40,0:04:02.64,EN,,0,0,0,,Uh, I definitely left some skin
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.40,0:04:02.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,今天我肯定在那半边场地上
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.64,0:04:05.28,EN,,0,0,0,,and blood on that side of the court.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.64,0:04:05.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,留下了几块皮和几滴血
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.28,0:04:07.68,EN,,0,0,0,,Um, but that'll always be the case for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.28,0:04:07.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,但我一直都是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.68,0:04:10.06,EN,,0,0,0,,So, thank you guys so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.68,0:04:10.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以 太谢谢你们了
